{"seq":3,"slug":"roi-measurement","title":"ROI 度量与优化决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/governance/roi-measurement","wordCount":1746,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"roi-度量与优化决策\">ROI 度量与优化决策</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>ROI 度量将成本优化从&quot;省钱&quot;升级为&quot;高效投资&quot;。核心工具：质量-成本帕累托前沿可视化当前配置相对最优的距离；边际分析决定下一美元应投向哪个优化项；结构化 ROI 公式（价值 = 直接营收 + 人力节省 + 质量改善，成本 = Token 费 + 工程维护 + 基础设施）让管理层理解 AI 投入产出。四个陷阱需要规避：过度优化损害质量、维护成本超过节省、局部优化全局恶化、追逐百分比而非绝对值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从-省钱-到-高效投资\">从&quot;省钱&quot;到&quot;高效投资&quot;</h2><p>成本优化如果只讲&quot;省了多少&quot;，它就永远是工程团队的内部事务，无法获得管理层的战略支持和持续投入。正确的叙事是：<strong>LLM 支出是一项投资，ROI 度量告诉我们这项投资是否高效，以及下一美元应该投向哪里。</strong></p>\n<p>ROI 的核心公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>ROI</mtext><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>AI 带来的价值</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>AI 总成本</mtext></mrow><mtext>AI 总成本</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ROI}_{AI} = \\frac{\\text{AI 带来的价值} - \\text{AI 总成本}}{\\text{AI 总成本}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ROI</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AI </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总成本</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AI </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">带来的价值</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AI </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总成本</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>但&quot;AI 带来的价值&quot;不容易量化。本文给出一套可操作的度量框架。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[ROI 度量框架] --&gt; B[成本端&lt;br/&gt;可精确量化]&#10;    A --&gt; C[价值端&lt;br/&gt;需要建模]&#10;    A --&gt; D[效率端&lt;br/&gt;质量-成本前沿]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; B1[直接成本&lt;br/&gt;Token 费用]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[间接成本&lt;br/&gt;工程/运维/机会成本]&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; C1[收入贡献&lt;br/&gt;付费功能带来的营收]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[效率提升&lt;br/&gt;节省的人力成本]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[质量改善&lt;br/&gt;减少的错误/投诉]&#10;&#10;    D --&gt; D1[帕累托前沿&lt;br/&gt;当前位置 vs 最优]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[边际分析&lt;br/&gt;下一美元的最优投向]\">graph TD\n    A[ROI 度量框架] --&gt; B[成本端&lt;br/&gt;可精确量化]\n    A --&gt; C[价值端&lt;br/&gt;需要建模]\n    A --&gt; D[效率端&lt;br/&gt;质量-成本前沿]\n\n    B --&gt; B1[直接成本&lt;br/&gt;Token 费用]\n    B --&gt; B2[间接成本&lt;br/&gt;工程/运维/机会成本]\n\n    C --&gt; C1[收入贡献&lt;br/&gt;付费功能带来的营收]\n    C --&gt; C2[效率提升&lt;br/&gt;节省的人力成本]\n    C --&gt; C3[质量改善&lt;br/&gt;减少的错误/投诉]\n\n    D --&gt; D1[帕累托前沿&lt;br/&gt;当前位置 vs 最优]\n    D --&gt; D2[边际分析&lt;br/&gt;下一美元的最优投向]</pre><h2 id=\"质量-成本帕累托前沿\">质量-成本帕累托前沿</h2><h3 id=\"什么是帕累托前沿\">什么是帕累托前沿</h3><p>对于任何 LLM 应用，存在一条质量-成本的帕累托前沿：在给定成本下能达到的最高质量（或给定质量下的最低成本）。任何低于这条线的配置都意味着&quot;还有改进空间&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置</th>\n<th>月成本</th>\n<th>质量分数</th>\n<th>位置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>A：全量 Opus</td>\n<td>$50,000</td>\n<td>95/100</td>\n<td>接近前沿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B：全量 Sonnet</td>\n<td>$30,000</td>\n<td>92/100</td>\n<td>接近前沿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C：路由（70% Haiku + 30% Sonnet）</td>\n<td>$12,000</td>\n<td>90/100</td>\n<td>在前沿上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>D：全量 Haiku</td>\n<td>$8,000</td>\n<td>82/100</td>\n<td>接近前沿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E：无优化 Sonnet + 臃肿 Prompt</td>\n<td>$45,000</td>\n<td>88/100</td>\n<td><strong>远低于前沿</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>配置 E 是典型的&quot;浪费&quot;状态——花了接近 Opus 的钱，却只得到低于 Sonnet 的质量。根因通常是：Prompt 臃肿导致关键指令被稀释、无缓存导致重复计费、无路由导致简单请求也用贵模型。</p>\n<h3 id=\"绘制你的帕累托前沿\">绘制你的帕累托前沿</h3><p>实操步骤：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>准备评估集</strong>：200-500 个代表性请求 + 金标准答案</li>\n<li><strong>遍历配置空间</strong>：不同模型 × 不同路由策略 × 缓存开关</li>\n<li><strong>记录每个配置的（成本, 质量）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>绘制散点图，连接帕累托前沿</strong></li>\n<li><strong>标注当前生产配置的位置</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;&#10;def find_pareto_front(configs: list[dict]) -&gt; list[dict]:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;找出帕累托最优配置&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    pareto = []&#10;    for config in sorted(configs, key=lambda x: x[&#39;cost&#39;]):&#10;        if not pareto or config[&#39;quality&#39;] &gt; pareto[-1][&#39;quality&#39;]:&#10;            pareto.append(config)&#10;    return pareto&#10;&#10;def distance_to_front(current: dict, pareto: list[dict]) -&gt; float:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;当前配置到帕累托前沿的距离（可优化空间）&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    # 找到成本相近的前沿点&#10;    nearest = min(pareto, key=lambda p: abs(p[&#39;cost&#39;] - current[&#39;cost&#39;]))&#10;    quality_gap = nearest[&#39;quality&#39;] - current[&#39;quality&#39;]&#10;    cost_gap = current[&#39;cost&#39;] - nearest[&#39;cost&#39;]&#10;    return quality_gap, cost_gap\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> find_pareto_front</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(configs: list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) -> list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"找出帕累托最优配置\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pareto </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sorted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(configs, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x: x[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cost'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pareto </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">or</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'quality'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pareto[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'quality'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            pareto.append(config)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pareto</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> distance_to_front</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(current: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, pareto: list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"当前配置到帕累托前沿的距离（可优化空间）\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 找到成本相近的前沿点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    nearest </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pareto, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(p[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cost'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cost'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    quality_gap </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nearest[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'quality'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'quality'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cost_gap </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cost'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nearest[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cost'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quality_gap, cost_gap</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"价值量化框架\">价值量化框架</h2><h3 id=\"类型一-直接收入贡献\">类型一：直接收入贡献</h3><p>如果 AI 功能是付费产品的核心——量化最直接：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>价值</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>AI 功能带来的月活跃付费用户</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>ARPU</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{价值} = \\text{AI 功能带来的月活跃付费用户} \\times \\text{ARPU}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">价值</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AI </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">功能带来的月活跃付费用户</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ARPU</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>示例：AI 写作助手，月付费用户 5000 人，ARPU <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mtext>，</mtext><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi><mtext>模块月成本</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20，AI 模块月成本</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">模块月成本</span></span></span></span></span>15,000</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ROI</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5000</mn><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">$</mi><mn>20</mn><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">$</mi><mn>15</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">$</mi><mn>15</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>567</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ROI} = \\frac{5000 \\times \\$20 - \\$15,000}{\\$15,000} = 567\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ROI</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3074em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">$15</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">$20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">$15</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">567%</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"类型二-效率提升-人力替代\">类型二：效率提升（人力替代）</h3><p>AI 自动化了原本需要人工完成的任务：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>价值</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>自动化请求数</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>人工单次成本</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>自动化成功率</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{价值} = \\text{自动化请求数} \\times \\text{人工单次成本} \\times \\text{自动化成功率}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">价值</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">自动化请求数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">人工单次成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">自动化成功率</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>示例：AI 客服每月自动解决 80,000 个请求，人工成本 $2/次，成功率 85%</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>价值</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">$</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.85</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">$</mi><mn>136</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>月</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{价值} = 80,000 \\times \\$2 \\times 0.85 = \\$136,000/\\text{月}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">价值</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">$2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.85</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">$136</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">月</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>月 AI 成本 $20,000 → ROI = 580%</p>\n<h3 id=\"类型三-质量改善\">类型三：质量改善</h3><p>AI 减少了错误、提升了准确率、降低了客诉：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>价值</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>错误率</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>错误数量</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>单次错误成本</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{价值} = \\Delta\\text{错误率} \\times \\text{错误数量} \\times \\text{单次错误成本}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">价值</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">错误率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">错误数量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单次错误成本</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>量化较难，通常需要对照实验或历史数据。</p>\n<h3 id=\"总-roi-计算模板\">总 ROI 计算模板</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>项目</th>\n<th>月金额</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>价值端</strong></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直接营收贡献</td>\n<td>$100,000</td>\n<td>付费用户 × ARPU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人力节省</td>\n<td>$50,000</td>\n<td>自动化替代</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量改善</td>\n<td>$10,000</td>\n<td>减少错误成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>价值合计</strong></td>\n<td><strong>$160,000</strong></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>成本端</strong></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LLM API 费用</td>\n<td>$25,000</td>\n<td>Token 直接成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工程维护</td>\n<td>$8,000</td>\n<td>人力分摊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基础设施</td>\n<td>$2,000</td>\n<td>缓存/队列等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>成本合计</strong></td>\n<td><strong>$35,000</strong></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>月 ROI</strong></td>\n<td><strong>357%</strong></td>\n<td>(160K-35K)/35K</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"边际分析-下一美元投向哪里\">边际分析：下一美元投向哪里</h2><p>当多个优化方向竞争有限的工程资源时，用边际分析决定优先级：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>边际 ROI</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>价值或节省</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>投入（工程时间 + 实施成本）</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{边际 ROI} = \\frac{\\Delta \\text{价值或节省}}{\\Delta \\text{投入（工程时间 + 实施成本）}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">边际</span><span class=\"mord\"> ROI</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">投入（工程时间</span><span class=\"mord\"> + </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">实施成本）</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">价值或节省</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化项</th>\n<th>预期月节省</th>\n<th>实施成本（一次性）</th>\n<th>月维护成本</th>\n<th>边际 ROI（首年）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>开启 Prompt Cache</td>\n<td>$3,000</td>\n<td>$500（配置改动）</td>\n<td>$0</td>\n<td>7200%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>静态规则路由</td>\n<td>$5,000</td>\n<td>$3,000（1周开发）</td>\n<td>$500</td>\n<td>1000%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Batch API 迁移</td>\n<td>$4,000</td>\n<td>$5,000（2周开发）</td>\n<td>$200</td>\n<td>700%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分类器路由</td>\n<td>$8,000</td>\n<td>$15,000（1月开发）</td>\n<td>$1,000</td>\n<td>400%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自建推理集群</td>\n<td>$15,000</td>\n<td>$50,000（设备+部署）</td>\n<td>$5,000</td>\n<td>130%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>按边际 ROI 排序的实施优先级：Prompt Cache → 静态路由 → Batch → 分类器路由 → 自建。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本效率的持续度量\">成本效率的持续度量</h2><h3 id=\"核心-kpi\">核心 KPI</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>KPI</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>目标方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单位成本</td>\n<td>总成本 / 总请求数</td>\n<td>↓</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本/价值比</td>\n<td>LLM 成本 / AI 功能营收</td>\n<td>↓（目标 &lt;25%）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量保持率</td>\n<td>优化后质量 / 优化前质量</td>\n<td>→ 维持 &gt;95%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存命中率</td>\n<td>缓存命中 / 总请求</td>\n<td>↑（目标 &gt;60%）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路由降级率</td>\n<td>低级模型处理比例</td>\n<td>↑（目标 &gt;60%）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预算利用率</td>\n<td>实际花费 / 分配预算</td>\n<td>→ 75-90%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"月度-roi-报告模板\">月度 ROI 报告模板</h3><p>向管理层汇报的结构化报告：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"## AI 成本月报 — 2026年7月&#10;&#10;### 关键指标&#10;&#10;- 本月总支出：$32,000（预算 $40,000，利用率 80%）&#10;- 环比变化：-12%（优化生效）&#10;- 质量分数：91/100（环比 +1，优化未损害质量）&#10;&#10;### ROI 概览&#10;&#10;- AI 功能月营收贡献：$180,000&#10;- 成本/营收比：17.8%（健康区间 &lt;25%）&#10;- 月 ROI：462%&#10;&#10;### 本月优化成果&#10;&#10;- Prompt Cache 上线：节省 $4,200/月&#10;- 路由系统优化：升级率从 25% 降至 18%&#10;- Batch 迁移完成：内容审核模块节省 50%&#10;&#10;### 下月计划&#10;&#10;- 优先级 1：分类器路由（预期额外节省 $6,000/月）&#10;- 优先级 2：Agent token budget 机制（防止失控）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## AI 成本月报 — 2026年7月</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### 关键指标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 本月总支出：$32,000（预算 $40,000，利用率 80%）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 环比变化：-12%（优化生效）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 质量分数：91/100（环比 +1，优化未损害质量）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### ROI 概览</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AI 功能月营收贡献：$180,000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 成本/营收比：17.8%（健康区间 &#x3C;25%）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 月 ROI：462%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### 本月优化成果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Prompt Cache 上线：节省 $4,200/月</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 路由系统优化：升级率从 25% 降至 18%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Batch 迁移完成：内容审核模块节省 50%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### 下月计划</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 优先级 1：分类器路由（预期额外节省 $6,000/月）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 优先级 2：Agent token budget 机制（防止失控）</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"避免优化陷阱\">避免优化陷阱</h2><h3 id=\"陷阱一-过度优化损害质量\">陷阱一：过度优化损害质量</h3><p>降本 80% 但质量从 92 分降到 75 分——用户流失导致的营收损失远超省下的 LLM 费用。</p>\n<p><strong>防护</strong>：设置质量红线，任何优化必须通过评估集验证质量保持在阈值以上。</p>\n<h3 id=\"陷阱二-优化维护成本超过节省\">陷阱二：优化维护成本超过节省</h3><p>一个复杂的路由系统每月节省 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mtext>，但需要半个工程师维护（月成本</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2,000，但需要半个工程师维护（月成本</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，但需要半个工程师维护（月成本</span></span></span></span></span>8,000）。</p>\n<p><strong>防护</strong>：在 ROI 计算中永远包含持续维护成本，不只看一次性节省。</p>\n<h3 id=\"陷阱三-局部优化全局恶化\">陷阱三：局部优化全局恶化</h3><p>过度压缩 Prompt 导致模型理解力下降 → 重试率翻倍 → 实际成本不降反升。</p>\n<p><strong>防护</strong>：优化前后对比的是<strong>总成本</strong>（含重试、降级、错误处理），而非单次调用成本。</p>\n<h3 id=\"陷阱四-追逐百分比而非绝对值\">陷阱四：追逐百分比而非绝对值</h3><p>花 3 个月优化一个月支出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>200</mn><mtext>的功能降本</mtext><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">200 的功能降本 50%——节省</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的功能降本</span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span>100/月，工程成本 $30,000。</p>\n<p><strong>防护</strong>：优先优化绝对值大的模块。成本前 3 的模块通常贡献 70% 以上的优化空间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>ROI 度量是成本优化工作获得组织持续支持的关键。帕累托前沿揭示&quot;还有多少改进空间&quot;；边际分析指导&quot;下一步做什么&quot;（按 ROI 排序：Prompt Cache &gt; 静态路由 &gt; Batch &gt; 分类器路由 &gt; 自建）；月度报告用业务语言向管理层展示投入产出。始终记住四个陷阱：不要为了省钱牺牲质量、不要优化维护成本超过节省、确保看总成本而非单次成本、优先优化绝对值大的模块。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p>相关文档：<a href=\"budget-allocation\">预算分配与熔断</a> ROI 度量为预算分配提供数据依据</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ROI 度量与优化决策","id":"roi-度量与优化决策"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从\"省钱\"到\"高效投资\"","id":"从-省钱-到-高效投资"},{"level":2,"text":"质量-成本帕累托前沿","id":"质量-成本帕累托前沿"},{"level":3,"text":"什么是帕累托前沿","id":"什么是帕累托前沿"},{"level":3,"text":"绘制你的帕累托前沿","id":"绘制你的帕累托前沿"},{"level":2,"text":"价值量化框架","id":"价值量化框架"},{"level":3,"text":"类型一：直接收入贡献","id":"类型一-直接收入贡献"},{"level":3,"text":"类型二：效率提升（人力替代）","id":"类型二-效率提升-人力替代"},{"level":3,"text":"类型三：质量改善","id":"类型三-质量改善"},{"level":3,"text":"总 ROI 计算模板","id":"总-roi-计算模板"},{"level":2,"text":"边际分析：下一美元投向哪里","id":"边际分析-下一美元投向哪里"},{"level":2,"text":"成本效率的持续度量","id":"成本效率的持续度量"},{"level":3,"text":"核心 KPI","id":"核心-kpi"},{"level":3,"text":"月度 ROI 报告模板","id":"月度-roi-报告模板"},{"level":2,"text":"避免优化陷阱","id":"避免优化陷阱"},{"level":3,"text":"陷阱一：过度优化损害质量","id":"陷阱一-过度优化损害质量"},{"level":3,"text":"陷阱二：优化维护成本超过节省","id":"陷阱二-优化维护成本超过节省"},{"level":3,"text":"陷阱三：局部优化全局恶化","id":"陷阱三-局部优化全局恶化"},{"level":3,"text":"陷阱四：追逐百分比而非绝对值","id":"陷阱四-追逐百分比而非绝对值"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"预算分配与熔断机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/governance/budget-allocation"},"next":null}